rthdays, corporate celebrations, and festive parties.\",\"buyer_summary\":\"Event planners, wedding couples, family celebrants, and event coordinators.\",\"cta_label\":\"Get My Event Quote\",\"landing_path\":\"/events\",\"active\":true,\"sort_order\":2,\"created_by\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T21:31:18.328125+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-05T21:31:18.328125+00:00\"}, \n {\"id\":\"af2fc88b-5faa-4cc9-8692-1bcdbb01f019\",\"tenant_id\":\"42d36cee-4cd6-43d1-af5d-334e5a07e37c\",\"slug\":\"hotels-hospitality\",\"name\":\"Hotels & Hospitality\",\"headline\":\"Turnkey Beverage Supply for Hotels, Lounges & Restaurants\",\"description\":\"Reliable cold-chain replenishment, bar stock, and breakfast buffet juice carafes with official trade invoicing.\",\"buyer_summary\":\"Hotel F&B managers, lounge operators, resorts, and café proprietors.\",\"cta_label\":\"Request Hotel Supply\",\"landing_path\":\"/hotels\",\"active\":true,\"sort_order\":3,\"created_by\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T21:31:21.134632+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-05T21:31:21.134632+00:00\"}, \n {\"id\":\"151a6847-9654-4f90-94f2-49a674b1b35b\",\"tenant_id\":\"42d36cee-4cd6-43d1-af5d-334e5a07e37c\",\"slug\":\"schools\",\"name\":\"Schools & Campuses\",\"headline\":\"Wholesome Fruit Hydration for Students & School Events\",\"description\":\"Zero artificial preservatives, pure hibiscus botanical vitamins, and cold-packed drinks approved for school sports, tuck shops, and graduation ceremonies.\",\"buyer_summary\":\"School administrators, tuck shop vendors, PTAs, and parent coordinators.\",\"cta_label\":\"Request School Beverage Program\",\"landing_path\":\"/schools\",\"active\":true,\"sort_order\":4,\"created_by\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T21:31:23.792498+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-05T21:31:23.792498+00:00\"}, \n {\"id\":\"e224e7f3-310c-4f43-8913-a3b0b8df9eec\",\"tenant_id\":\"42d36cee-4cd6-43d1-af5d-334e5a07e37c\",\"slug\":\"individuals\",\"name\":\"Individuals & Direct Orders\",\"headlin